{
  "name": "HL · Morning weather → Sheet",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## HL · Morning weather → Sheet (Lesson 3.1)\nEvery day at 06:30 (Lagos time) this gets Ibadan's forecast from Open-Meteo (no key needed), shapes it into one row with advice for the riders, and appends it to the HL Weather sheet.\n\n**Before you import: start n8n with a volume and your timezone**\n```\ndocker volume create n8n_data\n\ndocker run -it --name n8n -p 5678:5678 \\\n  -e GENERIC_TIMEZONE=\"Africa/Lagos\" \\\n  -e TZ=\"Africa/Lagos\" \\\n  -e N8N_ENFORCE_SETTINGS_FILE_PERMISSIONS=true \\\n  -e N8N_RUNNERS_ENABLED=true \\\n  -v n8n_data:/home/node/.n8n \\\n  n8nio/n8n\n```\nOpen http://localhost:5678 and create the owner account. (No Docker? Use an n8n Cloud trial.)\n\n**Credential:** Google Sheets (OAuth2). On Cloud, sign in with Google. Self-hosted: create an OAuth client in Google Cloud Console and paste the OAuth Redirect URL from n8n's credential window, character for character.\n\n**Placeholder:** YOUR_SHEET_ID in the Google Sheets node.",
        "height": 620,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "ba0a52b5-a4d3-4820-b73b-5fe815696d95",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -484,
        -180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "daysInterval": 1,
              "triggerAtHour": 6,
              "triggerAtMinute": 30
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "54900216-4229-4540-94dc-a01b17474b40",
      "name": "Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://api.open-meteo.com/v1/forecast?latitude=7.38&longitude=3.94&daily=temperature_2m_max,precipitation_sum,precipitation_probability_max&timezone=Africa%2FLagos&forecast_days=1",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "77eed226-585c-4b20-9238-96c6bb7e9be8",
      "name": "HTTP Request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "1e74e006-8d88-4502-bff2-dd39fb6272ac",
              "name": "date",
              "value": "={{ $json.daily.time[0] }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "f40ae914-bf0f-4a0f-b394-395c41e1eaa8",
              "name": "max_temp_c",
              "value": "={{ $json.daily.temperature_2m_max[0] }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "bd6b70d5-8f48-4922-ad3f-e32069e8ad90",
              "name": "rain_chance",
              "value": "={{ $json.daily.precipitation_probability_max[0] }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "e6bf03bc-251d-450f-8c19-139f10c160bc",
              "name": "rain_mm",
              "value": "={{ $json.daily.precipitation_sum[0] }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "77d65dfc-1964-4aa0-a8b7-d1e82010e428",
              "name": "advice",
              "value": "={{ $json.daily.precipitation_probability_max[0] >= 60 ? \"Rain likely: pack tarpaulins, start deliveries early\" : \"Dry day: normal routes\" }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "14ed53d5-9a96-453c-8ab8-afc5a3b14629",
      "name": "Edit Fields",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
