    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## The sheet, then Publish\nSpreadsheet **HL Weather**, first tab (Sheet1), headers in row 1:\ndate · max_temp_c · rain_chance · rain_mm · advice\nMapping is Map Automatically, so the names must match exactly.\n\nClick **Execute workflow** once: a row appears. Then **Save**, then **Publish**. Saving alone never runs on a schedule. Tomorrow, check Executions for a run you didn't start.\n\nA laptop only runs this if Docker is up and the laptop is awake at 06:30 (moves to a server in 3.8).",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 440
      },
      "id": "0db290c1-2812-4fb7-9095-47593b7ddcc1",
      "name": "Sheet and publish",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        330,
        144
      ]
    }
